<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8470 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8470 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8470 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>					  April 15	   April 14</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8470	     1.8470</p>
<p> Volume traded			$3.47 million	  $7.31 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
